  "prefLabel": "Tax 201.02 Communications with the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 201.02 Communications with the Board.\n\n(a) All communications shall be addressed to the board clerk or his or her designee and not to any board member.\n\n(b) Ex parte communications shall be strictly prohibited pursuant to RSA 541-A:36.\n\n(c) All requests for board action shall be made in writing and when appropriate by motion under Tax 201.18.\n\nSource. #2943, eff 12-31-84; amd by #4589, eff 3-21-89; ss by #5638, eff 9-1-93; amd by #6762, eff 7-1-98; amd by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #8986, eff 9-24-07; ss by #10624, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13687, eff 7-19-23",
